二、数据与隐私 / Data & Privacy
--------------------------------
本项目为纯浏览器扩展：所有数据（链接、编辑记录、偏好设置）仅存储在用户
浏览器本地，作者不收集、不上传任何用户数据。
This is a pure browser extension: all data (links, edits, preferences) is
stored locally in the user's browser. The author collects and uploads
nothing.

